{"type":"text","timestamp":1784901663833,"sessionID":"ses_06b932116ffeb4idBQzyBxlARf","part":{"id":"prt_f946de3f6001UKB14wydRFcwiK","messageID":"msg_f946dd80c0017EP1gkKU0Etjo1","sessionID":"ses_06b932116ffeb4idBQzyBxlARf","type":"text","text":"查询完成。在2013-2015期间冲刺速度(sprint_speed)不低于97的球员中，只有**Mathis Bolly**一人符合条件。\n\n| 球员姓名 | 出生日期 | 当前年龄 |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| Mathis Bolly | 1990-11-14 | 35 |\n\n**数据来源：**\n- 通过 `er_semantic_query` 召回 `Player_Attributes` 和 `Player` 实体（库: `european_football_2`）\n- 通过 `get_entity_mapping` 获取物理表映射和 database_url\n- 通过 `execute_sql` 执行 JOIN 查询，筛选 sprint_speed >= 97 且 date 年份在 2013-2015 之间的球员，并按 birthday 计算当前年龄\n\nFinal Answer: Mathis Bolly, age 35\nEvidence SQL: SELECT p.player_name, p.birthday, CAST((julianday('now') - julianday(p.birthday)) / 365.25 AS INTEGER) as age FROM Player_Attributes pa JOIN Player p ON pa.player_api_id = p.player_api_id WHERE pa.sprint_speed >= 97 AND CAST(strftime('%Y', pa.date) AS INTEGER) >= 2013 AND CAST(strftime('%Y', pa.date) AS INTEGER) <= 2015 GROUP BY p.player_api_id","time":{"start":1784901657590,"end":1784901663823}}}
